{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只陈述欢喜未能带来保证、仍想被选择以及不再能否认自己在意，没有新增外部事件，也没有把珠子的比喻写成真实行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"曾经收住心意和后来尽情喜欢都能在前文找到依据，这里是在对照两种状态都未能解决的悬而未决，并非新增往事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"它写的是他如何同时守住不施压与不压抑渴望，没有把珠子中的脚步、叹息或苦涩话语写成真实场景或对白。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S12-3已经明确对方没有给出保证、想被同样选择的愿望仍悬着，直接支撑S13-1的无保证与仍想被选择。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S01-2解释了他为何因怕关系变样而收住心意，却没有直接解释这种克制为何仍伴随着想被珍惜的愿望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"S08-2能支撑他后来允许自己沉浸在欢喜里，却没有直接说明这份快乐为何不能判断对方会不会选择自己。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条线形成了清楚的推进：欢喜没有消除对回应的渴望，克制与尽情喜欢都没能解决不确定性，最后他选择既不逼迫对方，也不否认自己的愿望。\",\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S13-1\",\n        \"S13-2\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条都表达了欢喜不能保证对方会选择自己，尤其S13-2的后半句与S13-1的无保证重复；保留克制与尽情喜欢的对照有价值，但可以压缩重复的结论。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S13-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"一条用分号串起不转嫁不安、不削弱喜欢、不催促、承受拉扯和不否认渴望等多层意思，信息略显拥挤，可以压缩为既不逼对方，也不压下自己的渴望，宁可承受拉扯。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1af12b1f-8c7d-45c0-b549-8006d94825c8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T065017649018Z", "elapsed_seconds": 371.297, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:56:28.953606+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "12906658a0094ed2066931246af6620731d50493e83ba6178c52ac6b7430e5ed", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T065017649018Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3717097a4ff7b1ed239db42b2cc5adce7386630eb8df46423f94efa21af4f313"}}}
